<title>USA: AST Research CFO Joseph Norberg resigns.</title>
<headline>AST Research CFO Joseph Norberg resigns.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>AST Research Inc said Friday its senior vice president and chief financial officer, Joseph Norberg, had left the company to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>Norberg had been CFO since last May.  </p>
<p>AST said it is starting a recruitment search to fill the CFO post. In the interim, Won Suk Yang, AST director and Samsung Electronics Co Ltd senior executive managing director, will serve as acting CFO, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
